-# jake.e.torres
+# Lions Motorsports — LMU Formula SAE
+
+A responsive, static website for Loyola Marymount University's Formula SAE team. The site includes pages for the team, subteams, partners, gallery, events, and contact information.
+
+## Preview locally
+
+```bash
+python3 -m http.server 8000
+```
+
+Then visit `http://localhost:8000`.
+
+## Customize
+
+- Replace the labeled image placeholders in the HTML with `<img>` elements.
+- Replace `lionmotorsports@lmu.edu` in `contact.html` with the team's official email.
+- Update partner cards and social links as they become available.
+
+The site uses plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript and can be deployed directly with GitHub Pages.
